{"id": "De82EmlP5ow", "title": "Video by nick_saraev", "description": "Comment \"CLONE\" to get this Free AI Tool that rebuilds any app you pay for with Claude Code.\n\nYou can now clone any app with Claude Code.\n\nSo you never have to pay for a subscription again.\n\nIt's called Replica, and it's not another reverse engineering repo.\n\nIt's a collection of 11 skills that build a better version of any app.\n\nAnd it's completely free.\n\nYou install it in Claude Code and point it at any app.\n\nFirst, it maps out every screen and feature.\n\nThen it reads the reviews on the App Store, G2 and Reddit.\n\nThat's how it finds what users hate, so it knows what to fix.\n\nNext, it rebuilds the app one screen at a time.\n\nIt solves those problems as it goes.\n\nPlus it adds the backend and tests every flow and screen for bugs.\n\nIt's like a contractor who reads every complaint before building.\n\nAnd finally, it gives the app its own branding and packages it up.\n\nSo you end up with a better app that's completely yours.\n\n#claudecode #reverseengineeranything #replicaai #REA #githubrepo", "channel": "nick_saraev", "uploader_id": "72269881052", "uploader": "Nick Saraev", "timestamp": 1793003077, "like_count": 2955, "comment_count": 4136, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-1609917977296520a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 65.404, "asr": 48000, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.famd5-4.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQO6prb2prPRiAYNh5ZKNq_9gVFUx-j7QgE62xaGWMqr31C96SLXwBVNHZ3UxvuklOoYqTK5Gwis6Hc6-H-rro5EZZcoGvMPrCpPDl4.mp4?_nc_cat=103&_nc_oc=Adqr6h3p87zMSwhvat7Q4n5X7lcf6rn1hsfzfgCZ4Yov5Me43vfb1F8MitTmDcldrcA&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.famd5-4.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=84IqseCITooQ7kNvwGVEtYh&%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=Va4x4Xf7Vi1Vd01lEfWoFg&_nc_ss=70a8c&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQSTj8xYRdoI1wJ0nC0lHUv-ZPqB_UGhTmWO3yi2oqOPcQ&oe=6AE